Package: repdist
Title: Homology-Aware Beta Diversity from Protein Language Model Embeddings
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: person("Yixuan", "Yang", email = "yixuanyang309@icloud.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Sample distances for metaproteomics that represent each sample as an
    abundance-weighted distribution over protein embeddings in a frozen protein
    language model space, then compares samples by maximum mean discrepancy
    under an RBF kernel. The ground distance is defined for any sequence,
    including proteins with no tree position or annotation. Returns 'dist'
    objects for direct use with vegan::adonis2().
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/Yixuan39/repdist
BugReports: https://github.com/Yixuan39/repdist/issues
